WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<v Priya Nair>Call two. A batch of changes and a few confirmations from the scoping workshop.</v>

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.500
<v Jose Ruiz>First change: drop the cash payment option. Card only from now on.</v>

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
<v Priya Nair>Understood. And the three-strike cancellation rule?</v>

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.500
<v Jose Ruiz>The three-strike cancellation rule stays as is, no change there.</v>

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.500
<v Nadia Farouk>There's a wrinkle here.</v>

6
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:30.500
<v Jose Ruiz>A provider must upload a valid government ID and a current insurance certificate before their first job, and both documents are re-checked every 12 months.</v>

7
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000
<v Priya Nair>Good. Let's also remove the phone support channel for now. Support is email and in-app chat only.</v>

8
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:40.000
<v>Should the itemised invoice still go out within 24 hours?</v>

9
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.500
<v Jose Ruiz>Yes, the 24-hour invoice rule is unchanged.</v>

10
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.500
<v Jose Ruiz>Change the booking-confirmation reminder from 2 hours to 1 hour after the booking is made.</v>

11
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.000
<v José Álvarez>On job photos, the completed-job report can include up to 10 photos from the provider.</v>

12
00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:01.500
<v Priya Nair>On weekend slots there is still no decision. Finance is still discussing it internally.</v>

13
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.500
<v Jose Ruiz>That is everything for today. Let's talk next week.</v>
